title: "SRL: Simple Reinforcement Learning"
abstract: >-
  A modular, YAML-first PyTorch reinforcement learning library for continuous
  control (PPO, SAC, DDPG, TD3, A2C, A3C) with Gymnasium, MuJoCo, Fetch
  robotics, Isaac Lab and mjlab adapters.
